{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">~ Story ~</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mamizou Futatsuiwa, the boss of the haunted raccoon dogs, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">checks on the changes in the raccoon dogs under his command!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But Mamizou is too busy to spend much time on this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have to quickly find out the changes in a short period of time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1. About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a speedy mistake-finding game, a derivative of Touhou Project! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(this is fangame.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2. Check the wrong parts compared to the sample!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The parts to be checked are roughly divided into three parts: head, upper waist, and lower waist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compare with the sample and select \u201cOK\u201d for the correct part and \u201cNG\u201d for the wrong part!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are various kinds of mistakes, such as the color of the parts, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the presence or absence of decorations, differences in the belongings, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some of them may be completely different from the sample...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3. Speed up the game by answering correctly in a row!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you answer 3 questions in a row correctly without making a mistake, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the game speed will increase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be able to check more raccoon dogs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">4. Various characters appear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The characters that will change are the well-known Touhou characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you advance through the stages, more characters will appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you know the characters well, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you may be able to recognize them without comparing them with the samples!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">5. Finally</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy!!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start checking!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369570/70d4e7c2fdcf48213ef45916649a0f9e67d52daa.jpg"},{"name":"Transform into the protagonist faction!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369570/07125f80dda4b633250ac17cad60722f6850ae0a.jpg"},{"name":"Transform into a servant!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369570/3cd4a8e717106374c34a3959410626985a625f3f.jpg"},{"name":"Transform into a tengu!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369570/cebfc7bae32dea539efcfe4d23469a9b26090f2f.jpg"},{"name":"Transform into a magical girl!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369570/2288a2912be59b9dad1a77ba180c6fd89632f115.jpg"},{"name":"Quick and accurate check!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3369570/2a7bf06b1b8784331075022759942985bebe7582.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3369570?t=1742634122","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3369570?t=1742634122","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369570/16aac80d7ff3e42bd5fa3cca96fd4becadd65988/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742634122","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369570/16aac80d7ff3e42bd5fa3cca96fd4becadd65988/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742634122","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">~ Story ~</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mamizou Futatsuiwa, the boss of the haunted raccoon dogs, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">checks on the changes in the raccoon dogs under his command!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But Mamizou is too busy to spend much time on this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have to quickly find out the changes in a short period of time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">1. About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a speedy mistake-finding game, a derivative of Touhou Project! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(this is fangame.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2. Check the wrong parts compared to the sample!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The parts to be checked are roughly divided into three parts: head, upper waist, and lower waist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compare with the sample and select \u201cOK\u201d for the correct part and \u201cNG\u201d for the wrong part!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are various kinds of mistakes, such as the color of the parts, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the presence or absence of decorations, differences in the belongings, etc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some of them may be completely different from the sample...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3. Speed up the game by answering correctly in a row!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you answer 3 questions in a row correctly without making a mistake, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the game speed will increase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be able to check more raccoon dogs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">4. Various characters appear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The characters that will change are the well-known Touhou characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you advance through the stages, more characters will appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you know the characters well, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you may be able to recognize them without comparing them with the samples!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">5. Finally</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy!!</p>","developers":["SOMARIYA"],"dlc":[3599780],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369570/header.jpg?t=1742634122","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112215,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112215/movie480.mp4?t=1741534138","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112215/movie_max.mp4?t=1741534138"},"name":"ver0.9","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112215/ec39cd8635d7c0d7c5192090bbe7293c400c1b61/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741534138","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112215/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741534138","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112215/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741534138"}}],"name":"Mamizou's Mimic Check","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Mamizou's Mimic Check - $2.99 USD","packageid":1192427,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":299}],"title":"Buy Mamizou's Mimic Check"}],"packages":[1192427],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Wondows10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":299,"final_formatted":"$2.99 USD","initial":299,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["SOMARIYA"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_